      "content": "that's a good start. it definitely captures that sense of urgency. but i want to push it a bit more on the 'why'. can u add a part where he addresses the critics? like, people who say this is basically just a soft dictatorship or that we're losing our humanity. i want him to respond to them by showing why their concerns are basically just outdated fears and why the transition is actually the most moral thing we can do for the people.",
